 "selected_compatible_because": [
  "dist/index.js and dist/serve.js stay byte-identical from 0.96.0 through 0.100.0, so an unset CLAUDE_AGENT_ACP_PROTOCOL still serves a protocolVersion 1 client the v1 agent",
  "dist/tools.js stays byte-identical, so tool task-list plumbing is unchanged",
  "deleteSessionIfStored stays byte-identical through 0.100.0, so live close and stored or unstored delete response shapes stay empty objects for this non-AIR client",
  "failure codes move to protocol error codes, and the adapter maps every JSON-RPC error to one rejected-request failure class, so no mapped failure class changes",
  "model, effort, and mode ids stay model, effort, and mode; the model option now always lists currentValue, and Swallowtail selects by value among listed options",
  "set_config_option gains a value-type check that string selections of select options pass, and per-session serialization changes ordering only",
  "prompt content-type validation rejects types Swallowtail never sends, and the adapter keeps one active turn per session, so the queued-prompt refinement is unreachable",
  "new agent_message_chunk, usage_update, and available_commands_update content sit inside already-decoded update kinds with unchanged shapes",
  "AIR, plan, notices, sessionIndex, async tasks, native subagents, boolean config options, and background work stay behind capabilities or options Swallowtail does not advertise; ACP v2 stays unqualified",
  "HTTP MCP live honouring stays exact to 0.79.0 and 0.81.2"
 ],
